window.products.push({"id":999063,"name":"Neoflam Mitra Ceramic Coated Nonstick Pancake Pan, 7 Cup Mold Griddle for Blini, Egg, Waffle, Burger Patty, Skillet, Breakfast, Easy Clean, PFOA Free,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eYNiBnR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Neoflam Pancake Pan Oblong pancakes are out of style. Enter the Neoflam Pancake Pan. It is guaranteed to turn your morning pancakes into a seamless stack every time. This unique piece of cookware can produce seven mini-pancakes at once. Simply pour batter into the molds and out pops a perfect circle. Of course, you can experiment with your own breakfast creations. For example, you could cook a couple pancakes, two eggs, a sausage patty, a slice of ham, and a piece of bacon in tandem to create a delicious breakfast sandwich a la minute! Neoflam cookware is produced with Ecolon ceramic coating. This is an all-natural alternative to traditional nonstick coatings, and it is free of PTFE/PFOA. When Ecolon is applied to the cast aluminum body, the cookware transforms into a deliciously colorful piece with amazing features including a lightweight frame, a durable body, and a scratch resistant, easy to clean surface. Features: Cast aluminum body is lightweight and highly heat conductive Cast aluminum body is lightweight and highly heat conductive Ecolon ceramic nonstick coating is made from all-natural materials Ecolon ceramic nonstick coating is made from all-natural materials Easy to clean and maintain Easy to clean and maintain Ecolon - The Healthy Choice for Nonstick Cookware Ecolon is Neoflam’s innovative nonstick ceramic coating made from all-natural materials. It is applied to the interior and exterior of our cookware, which extends the life of the product and ensures it is easy to use and maintain. The result is a healthier choice for people and the environment. Of course, it does not contain PTFE/PFOA. About Neoflam Neoflam has been at the forefront of cookware design and manufacturing since 2008. The combination of durable, lightweight cast aluminum and colorful ceramic coating brought early success as customers looked for new ways to liven up their kitchen. In 2014, Neoflam built a new factory in Korea, in addition to existing factories in China, that borrowed the latest industrial technologies from the automobile industry. This was to ensure Neoflam remains on the cutting edge of kitchen innovation while continuing to provide quality, products to our loyal customers all over the world. Neoflam - lighting a “new flame” in the kitchenware industry. Neoflam's leadership in product design has been recognized by the following prestigious design awards: iF (2012, 2016), Red Dot (2012, 2013, 2014), and Design Plus (2014).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eYNiBnR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neoflam","source_asin":"B0716P8ZCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-999063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0716P8ZCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0716P8ZCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
