window.products.push({"id":999274,"name":"Xlnt Extra Long Oven Mitts (Black) | Teflon EcoElite Water Repellent | Heat Resistant for Oven Cooking, Grill & BBQ | Non Slip Gloves with Teflon EcoE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917BieCWJAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silicone PREMIUM HIGH QUALITY OVEN MITTS: XLNT Long Oven Mitts are made with high-quality durable material to be comfortable and able to handle more heat than any other brand, to help you tackle all your kitchen needs. They are flexible high-grade silicone oven gloves with textured surfaces that give a strong grip and easy fit for most hands. It helps you hold tight to pans, pots, hot plates, dishware and baking sheets. Perfect for cooking; baking, BBQ, grilling, picnic, fryer, the fireplace and more. HEAT RESISTANT & WATERPROOF OVEN MITTS: XLNT heat resistant oven mitts are 100% waterproof and heat resistant up to 460°f/240°c, protecting your hands, wrists and forearms from hot cookware and boiling water. The silicone surface does not absorb liquids, ensuring your hands stay safe and dry so that you can go from stove to tabletop without a hassle. No more using traditional oven mitts that don’t protect, melt, get water logged and cause steam, grill and oven burns. EXTREME HOT & COLD PROTECTION : Whether you’re a home cook, commercial cook or making a backyard grill, these oven mitts are the best to prevent you from burning your hands, keeping you safe when touching ultra hot or cold items. Our 14 inch long oven gloves keep your whole hand protected. Better than your average BBQ oven mitts, these silicone gloves for cooking offer premium safety while setting up campfires, moving wood into a fireplace, smoking turkeys for thanksgiving and more. NON-SLIP SILICONE TEXTURED DESIGN: These silicone oven mitts have a black, textured surface that perfectly enhances traction and non-slip, restraining items such as hot pot dishes. When you’re not using a high heat oven mitt, then you can hang them on hooks in the kitchen with their hanging loop and round hole for suitable storage. These non slip silicone oven mitts provide improved control and stability. The soft cotton lining also adds an extra protection and comfort layer. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION ASSURED: Teflon oven mitts are designed and tested by chefs, durable, made of 100% ultra-grade silicone and offer superb heat resistance, are non-toxic, stain-resistant, easy to clean and machine washableIf you are at all unsatisfied with our products, please contact us and we will be happy to provide you with your choice of a replacement or refund. We want our customers to love our silicone baking oven gloves as much as we do! ADVANTAGE OF OUR TEFLON FINISH: Keeps fabric Looking new Longer While helping to lower impact of environment, removes 95% of oil and water based stains in the wash, Provides 9X more stain repellency versus other technologies, requires less washing to remove stains, can be washed in 50% lower wash temperatures, can dry up to 50% faster in the dryer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917BieCWJAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XLNT","source_asin":"B07VKCVGPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-999274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VKCVGPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VKCVGPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
