window.products.push({"id":999560,"name":"HBlife Premium 100% Cotton Blanket Queen Size, Soft Lightweight Breathable Waffle Weave Thermal Blanket for Home Decoration, Teal 90 X 90 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RjwHdfyyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURAL COTTON FABRIC - The HBlife woven from all-natural cotton, we adopt the simplified and exquisite manufacturing process without any chemicals or fire retardants to keep you and your family safe & healthy. Ring-spun cotton produced by a smoother and finer weave will bring you a softer sleep experience than regular cotton. ELEGANT WAFFLE PATTERN - HBlife 100% cotton blanket with a pliable construction features a plush and springy texture which will make blankets wonderfully soft - reminiscent of your seersucker shirts. Add extra texture to your decor and turns your room into an inviting space with this simple yet classy elegant waffle design; drape it over a chair, couch, or bed to add an exotic stylish touch to your living room or bedroom. SUPER SOFT&LIGHTWEIGHT - The HBlife cotton blanket is very breathable and great moisture absorption, promoting a deep, comfortable sleep for you. These superior quality cotton blankets provide you warmth all year round, even in the cold winters. We have kept the weight of our blankets light and perfect. These breathable and light-weight blankets are perfect in summers as well which makes it a perfect year-round product. VERSATILE USAGE SCENARIOS - Use it to drape over your couch, layer under a quilt, or just as a bedspread at the foot of your bed. Our cotton blanket is surely suitable for outdoor use like going picnic, traveling, camping, backpacking or just when you nap in your office or carry it in cars. Being able to take beautiful pictures on your social software as a photography prop, suitable for all seasons. Cats/dogs are NOT recommended to play on the blanket for snagging issues. CARE-FREE WASH - Machine wash colors separately wash in cold water, gentle cycle, follow the care label, tumble dry low if need. Remove promptly from the washing machine to avoid wrinkles. Made from 100% natural materials and no harmful chemicals or synthetic materials are added. Because of the special shrinkage rate of the waffle weave, the blanket size is a little bigger to avoid the shrink after washing. Do not bleach. Hang dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RjwHdfyyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBlife","source_asin":"B096P57WHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-999560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096P57WHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096P57WHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
