window.products.push({"id":999624,"name":"Bathroom Shower Organizer, POTRAS Aluminum Shower Shelves with 4 Hook, Wall Mounted Rustproof Shower Shelf for Inside Shower, Shower Caddy Adhesive fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YWSKtjktL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Save Space - Full Size Aluminum Shower Caddy:12.68\"L×5.2\"W×2.84\"H(SET of 2), bigger than most of the shower shelves on the market. POTRAS Shower Organizer could give you extra storage in Bathroom, Toilet, RV, Kitchen, and provide rustic decoration for your home space while allowing you to efficiently utilize space on walls. Durable Material & Fast Draining -Shower Organizer is made of premium Space Aluminum Material for long-lasting use. Aluminum is more rust-resistant than stainless steel and iron.One great advantage of this Space aluminum is that it doesn't rust. Aluminum Shower Caddy is as new as before after using for a long time. Designed for use in moisture-rich bathroom/kitchen environments-The bottom of our aluminum Shower caddy have hollow drainage and flat bottom design,which can hold very small bottles while allowing the water on the contents to dry quickly, effectively keeping dry and preventing scaling. Rather than a hollow design shower organizer that tilts when placing small bottles. Keep bath products and kitchen spices clean. Strong Load-bearing Capacity & Super Sturdy - POTRAS Shower Shelves have amazing holding power which can bear at least 40 lbs of 2-3 full-size shower bottles（32oz）. Strong traceless adhesive ensures the shower shelf stable, which can support the shower shelves and heavy things on the rack. Don't worry about Shower organizer or kitchen Spice Rack wobbling or falling apart any time even after months of use. Easy to Assemble & Remove - No-drilling design of adhesive shower caddy lets you install and hang up shower storage organizers easily by pasting sticky. No drilling, no tools and no damage to your shower walls. If you want to remove the adhesive shower organizer, you just need use the hair dryer to heat the adhesive and then take it down. Note: **Adhesive will have the glue residue left over when take it down.**","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YWSKtjktL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POTRAS","source_asin":"B09P4LXDNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-999624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P4LXDNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P4LXDNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
