window.products.push({"id":999652,"name":"Prefilled Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Two Piece Set - Includes Himalayan Salt and Quality Black Pepper - Glass and Stainless Steel Mill - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YXcot0HhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant looking set Airtight lid to lock in the flavor A high-quality adjustable ceramic rotor with five grinding levels from coarse to fine Simple and easy to use manual grinding A top loading no-mess design Comes prefilled with Genuine Himalayan Salt and with High Quality Black Peppercorns No batteries required SUPERIOR PERFORMANCE! Dependable! 6 oz. capacity, measures 2.5’’ wide by 7.5’’ tall Salt and pepper grinders are a necessary part of any chef's inventory. Whether you want fresh salt and pepper to make a meal or want to top off your dinner with some, having stale salt and pepper will not do. Nothing beats the freshly ground aroma and flavor of salt and pepper from salt pepper grinders, and with this Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, you can have just that. The Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set is a pair of pepper and salt grinder tools that will have your food tasting better than ever. This stainless steel salt pepper grinder combo comes prefilled with genuine Himalayan salt in one container, and high quality whole black peppercorns inside of the other container. With this salt pepper grinder, stainless steel works in harmony with durable glass to provide you with not only a beautiful Himalayan salt and pepper grinder but a long lasting one as well. This glass salt pepper grinder comes with a top loading design that eliminates the mess that other, bottom loading salt & pepper grinder sets produce. With just a turn of the hand, you can use the Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set during or after the cooking process to enjoy the best tasting food possible. There is no need for the installation of any sort of batteries thanks to this easy to use manual grinder. This is the best salt and pepper grinder for professional and amateur chefs to use. Order the Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set today by clicking add to cart now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YXcot0HhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mason Mills","source_asin":"B078RB28LT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-999652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078RB28LT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078RB28LT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
