window.products.push({"id":999749,"name":"Rice Storage Container, Lockcoo Foldable Airtight Cereal Food Storage Containers 20 to 50 Lbs with Measuring Cup & Wheels, Dry Food Flour Sugar Storag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61COdg4auxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plastic & TPR 【Extra-large Airtight Rice Container】Good dry food can make our life better. It has airtight seals and 4 side lock latches that effectively keep out moisture and pests, keep the dry food fresh and dry, full of flavor, and nutritious, so you never have to worry about your rice or pet food getting moldy, rotten, or bug-infested. Whether your main concern is freshness, capacity, or a container that's toxin-free, this container offers the best choices to keep your family in good diet. 【Special Collapsible Design for 2 Capacities】The foldable rice storage container is designed to be collapsible that can be adjusted to fit the size to store your kitchen dry food. Unfolded size can hold about 55 pounds of rice or 30 pounds of dog food. Folded size fit for 16 pounds of rice or 13 pounds of dog/cat food. Are you still worried about how to scoop the last bits of food out of the bottom of the tall container? Just fold it when less kitchen food then take out all dry food easily. 【BPA-Free & Food Grade Material】The grain storage container is made of BPA-free high-density polyethylene plastic, which is tough and durable.The middle folding part is TPR material, which is ductile and can be folded repeatedly. It is not only safe for flour, rice, nuts, legumes, grains, snacks, sugar, but also store your cute friends' dog food, pellets and snacks and any kind of pet and human food. We have tested the container ensure it to be strong and durable enough for long-lasting use. 【Unique Humanized Details】Multiple moisture-proof design includes sealing buckle, silicone sealing ring, and top cover with desiccant slot ensure food out of damp and keep pests and rodents from eating your kitchen food and pet food. Clear magnetic lids make it convenient to quickly check the food remaining amount and reduce the steps to open the big lid, easy take out dry food by attached scoop. There are two wheels at the bottom of the container for easy movement. 【Space Saver】The airtight rice storage bins is definitely a space saver, it won't take up much space in your cabinets or pantry. When you need to put it away or when less food, you just need to press it down hard to fold it up, put it under your dog station table or on the floor under the lowest shelf. If any unsatisfy with the purchase, just reach out to us, our customer service team is always ready to assist you for any small complication or dissatisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61COdg4auxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lockcoo","source_asin":"B0B9388Y33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-999749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9388Y33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9388Y33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
