window.products.push({"id":1000001,"name":"ZOBER Premium Large Carrying Christmas Ornament Storage Box with Clear Lid, 3\" Compartment, Contains 10 Trays, Keeps 200 Holiday Ornaments & Xmas Acce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iXyv8DLPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organized Ornaments-The ornament organizer tidily holds a whooping 100 three-inch ornaments in individual carry trays, the customizable gridded slots allowing you to adjust the exact number. The trays can be singularly removed and carried from room to room as you merrily stock them with ornaments to your heart’s content. Compact Storage-Works like a box; stores like a bag! The organizer is sturdy and freestanding, supported by the trays rather than cardboard inserts. Despite the enormous number of ornaments it holds, it is dainty and compact, takes up less space, and folds flat. Sturdy carry handles let you breezily swing the organizer to its designated spot. Durable Construction-Crafted of supreme 600D oxford, the ornament organizer’s tough construction will withstand years of use and abuse. The water-resistant interior and tearproof exterior create an everlasting combination that ensures the organizer is shielded from moisture, and rips. Access and Protection-A brilliantly clear PVC window on the top grants you visual access to the organizer’s contents. Always know what you have in storage to avoid pricey duplicate purchases. The zippered top protecting your ornaments from dust and debris opens wide for easy ornament placement and removal. Holiday Cheer- Cheery Christmas colors liven up the atmosphere and make packing up the holiday a pleasurable and joyful experience. Designed with lively hues, it lends a sophisticated yet exciting look to your ornament storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iXyv8DLPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOBER","source_asin":"B09NYLX8Z4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1000001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NYLX8Z4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NYLX8Z4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
